            {
              "content": "=Write only the body of the email.\n\nDo NOT include:\n- Subject\n- Greeting\n- Signature\n\nCustomer Name:\n{{ $(\"Quote Request Form\").item.json.name }}\n\nSelected Service:\n{{ $(\"Quote Request Form\").item.json.service_type }}\n\nCustomer Description:\n{{ $(\"Quote Request Form\").item.json.details }}\n\nAI Job Type:\n{{ $(\"Analyze Request\").item.json.output[0].content[0].text.job_type }}\n\nUrgency:\n{{ $(\"Analyze Request\").item.json.output[0].content[0].text.urgency }}\n\nCompany:\n{{ $(\"Company Settings\").item.json.company_name }}\n\nResponse Time:\n{{ $(\"Company Settings\").item.json.response_time }}\n\nCompany Phone:\n{{ $(\"Company Settings\").item.json.company_phone }}\n\nWrite one warm, professional paragraph.\n\nRequirements:\n\n- Thank them for contacting the company.\n- Briefly acknowledge their roofing concern.\n- Mention that their request has been received.\n- Let them know someone from the company will contact them within the configured response time.\n- If urgency is High, advise them to call immediately if conditions worsen.\n- End naturally without a signature."
            }
          ]
